Hearing filed yesterday, the Center’s main building is closed until September 23, 2026, at the
earliest, to “address imminent life-safety risks” identified with the Center’s soffit panels, electrical
infrastructure, and other structural deterioration. See Ex. A to Sep. 16 Floca Decl. at 2, ECF No.
86-2. “The need to extend this temporary closure will be evaluated on a weekly basis.” Id.
