during renovations, “the John F. Kennedy Center for the Performing Arts shall continue to

present educational and artistic programming at the REACH[.]” Id. (emphasis added); id. at 6

(Secretary of Commerce Howard Lutnick suggesting “the Center” included “The REACH”).

