Bogert’s Law of Trusts § 391. And a “charitable trustee has the same duty as a private trustee to

administer the trust according to its terms and applicable law.” Id. § 394. The charitable nature

of the Kennedy Center trust does not magically relieve Beatty of the fiduciary duties that she

would discharge by pursuing and prevailing in this lawsuit.

