satisfy a four-factor test before a court may grant such relief.’” Anatol Zukerman & Charles

Krause Reporting, LLC v. USPS, 64 F.4th 1354, 1364 (D.C. Cir. 2023) (quoting eBay Inc. v.

MercExchange, LLC, 547 U.S. 388, 391 (2006)). She must demonstrate that (1) she has

