inadequate to compensate for that injury”; (3) “considering the balance of hardships between the

plaintiff and defendant, a remedy in equity is warranted”; and (4) “that the public interest would

not be disserved by a permanent injunction.” Id. (quoting eBay, 547 U.S. at 391).

