damage that could far outlast the closure; potentially permanent loss of highly-specialized arts

professionals; and long-term attrition of donors. See Borda Decl. ¶¶ 7–15; Taylor Decl. ¶¶ 5–13;

Borenstein Decl. ¶¶ 9–25.

